'''Black Hole Rising (Insane)''' is the 6th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and appears every Thursday. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Drumcorps Cat (Rare Cat)|Drumcorps Cat]].

