==Strategy==
The [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] are almost required for this stage. 400% is probably the minimum, but 600% is ideal. This Cyclone has longer range than most other Cyclones, can decrease the attack power of Cat Units, and has a damage boost when its health is low, making it a formidable opponent.

Like all Cyclones, Cosmic Cyclone is very weak to crowd-control. The best options to defeat it using crowd-control are [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]], as both outrange the Cyclone. Cosmic Cyclone has another weakness: its minimal support. Shibaliens and Those Guys are the only other enemies in this stage, which are weak peons. With luck, your crowd-controllers can easily stunlock the Cyclone, leaving other units to take it down.

